{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"I don't want to have anything to do with you.","note":"لا أريد أن تكون أية صلة بين و بينك."},{"btype":"example","text":"I thought you didn't know how to do anything.","note":"ظننت أنّك لا تعرف فعل أيّ شيء."},{"btype":"example","text":"It really doesn't have anything to do with you.","note":"لا علاقة بهذا معك."},{"btype":"example","text":"That's too much.","note":"هذا كثير."},{"btype":"example","text":"That's about all.","note":"هذا كل شيء تقريبا."},{"btype":"example","text":"That's good to know.","note":"من الجيد معرفة ذلك"},{"btype":"example","text":"That's what I thought.","note":"ذلك ما ظننته"},{"btype":"example","text":"That's why I like you.","note":"لذلك أحبك"},{"btype":"example","text":"That's what people say.","note":"هذا ما يقوله الناس."},{"btype":"example","text":"That's what Yanni said.","note":"هذا ما قاله ياني."},{"btype":"example","text":"Tom said that's not what he did.","note":"توم قَالَ أنَّهُ لَمْ يَفعَل ذلِك"},{"btype":"example","text":"That's not what I wanted to tell you.","note":"ليس هذا ما أردت إخبارك عنه."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"I don't want to have anything to do with you.","ar":"لا أريد أن تكون أية صلة بين و بينك."},{"t":"I thought you didn't know how to do anything.","ar":"ظننت أنّك لا تعرف فعل أيّ شيء."},{"t":"It really doesn't have anything to do with you.","ar":"لا علاقة بهذا معك."},{"t":"That's too much.","ar":"هذا كثير."},{"t":"That's about all.","ar":"هذا كل شيء تقريبا."},{"t":"That's good to know.","ar":"من الجيد معرفة ذلك"},{"t":"That's what I thought.","ar":"ذلك ما ظننته"},{"t":"That's why I like you.","ar":"لذلك أحبك"},{"t":"That's what people say.","ar":"هذا ما يقوله الناس."},{"t":"That's what Yanni said.","ar":"هذا ما قاله ياني."},{"t":"Tom said that's not what he did.","ar":"توم قَالَ أنَّهُ لَمْ يَفعَل ذلِك"},{"t":"That's not what I wanted to tell you.","ar":"ليس هذا ما أردت إخبارك عنه."},{"t":"Tom has money.","ar":"توم لديه نقود"},{"t":"Sami had money.","ar":"كان عند سامي مال."},{"t":"Ziri has money.","ar":"يملك زيري مالا."},{"t":"I have no money.","ar":"ليس لدي أي مال."},{"t":"Yanni has money.","ar":"ياني يملك مالا."},{"t":"Yanni had money.","ar":"كان ياني يملك المال."},{"t":"I want some money.","ar":"أريد بعض المال."},{"t":"Do you need money?","ar":"هل أنت بحاجة إلى المال؟"},{"t":"Do you have money?","ar":"هل لديك نقود؟"},{"t":"There is no money.","ar":"لا يوجد مال."},{"t":"Sami had the money.","ar":"كان المال عند سامي."},{"t":"I don't have money.","ar":"ليس لدي نقود"},{"t":"Sami got his money.","ar":"تحصّل سامي على ماله."},{"t":"Sami got the money.","ar":"تحصّل سامي على المال."},{"t":"It's my money, too.","ar":"هذا مالي أيضا."},{"t":"Do they need money?","ar":"هل يحتاجون إلى مال؟"},{"t":"Does she have money?","ar":"هل عندها مال؟"},{"t":"Do we have the money?","ar":"هل لدينا المال؟"}],"focus":[],"difficulty":5}}